      "source": [
        "## 3. Key Procurement Metrics Calculation\n",
        "\n",
        "Now that the data is loaded correctly, I will calculate several key procurement metrics:\n",
        "\n",
        "*   **Total PO Spend**: The sum of all 'Invoice Amount (PKR)'.\n",
        "*   **Total Number of POs**: The count of unique 'PO Number' entries.\n",
        "*   **Total Number of Vendors**: The count of unique 'Vendor' entries.\n",
        "*   **Average PO Value**: Total PO Spend divided by the Total Number of POs.\n",
        "*   **Average Line-Item Value**: Total PO Spend divided by the total number of line items (rows)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "4fa76b6d",
        "outputId": "2071b0c6-8fac-487f-be09-324619103dfb"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Calculate Total PO Spend\n",
        "total_po_spend = df['Invoice Amount (PKR)'].sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate Total Number of POs (unique 'PO Number')\n",
        "total_pos = df['PO Number'].nunique()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate Total Number of Vendors (unique 'Vendor')\n",
        "total_vendors = df['Vendor'].nunique()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate Average PO Value\n",
        "# This is the total spend divided by the number of unique POs\n",
        "average_po_value = total_po_spend / total_pos\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate Average Line-Item Value\n",
        "# This is the total spend divided by the total number of rows (each row is considered a line item)\n",
        "average_line_item_value = total_po_spend / len(df)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Display the calculated metrics\n",
        "print(f\"Total PO Spend: {total_po_spend:,.2f} PKR\")\n",
        "print(f\"Total Number of Purchase Orders: {total_pos}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Total Number of Vendors: {total_vendors}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Average Purchase Order Value: {average_po_value:,.2f} PKR\")\n",
        "print(f\"Average Line-Item Value: {average_line_item_value:,.2f} PKR\")"
      ],
